      "text": "Well, let's look at the language before this gets too far.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请继续提供需要翻译的英文内容。",
      "start": 115.84,
      "end": 122.0
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的，以下是“所有好”的翻译：",
      "start": 122.0,
      "end": 123.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's take a look at language takeaway.",
