      "end": 135.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Heard.",
      "trans": "听见了。",
      "start": 135.44,
      "end": 136.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Heard.",
      "trans": "英语：Heard.",
      "start": 136.44,
      "end": 137.44
    },
    {
      "text": "So you guys know this word.",
      "trans": "英语：所以你们知道这个单词。",
      "start": 137.44,
      "end": 138.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Past tense of here, right?",
      "trans": "过去时的“这里”是哪里？",
      "start": 138.68,
      "end": 140.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是该短语的中文翻译：",
      "start": 140.08,
      "end": 141.08
    },
    {
      "text": "The way it's used is quite interesting.",
