      "start": 143.08,
      "end": 148.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Example one.",
      "trans": "Example one: 一台单反相机。",
      "start": 148.24,
      "end": 149.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I heard you're dating a new guy.",
      "trans": "我听说你正在约会一个新男友。",
      "start": 149.24,
      "end": 157.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Example two.",
      "trans": "翻译成中文是：",
      "start": 157.24,
      "end": 158.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Julie told me she heard that you're pregnant.",
