      "start": 166.4,
      "end": 169.4
    },
    {
      "text": "What?",
      "trans": "什么？",
      "start": 169.4,
      "end": 170.4
    },
    {
      "text": "I heard that you quit.",
      "trans": "我听说你辞职了。",
      "start": 170.4,
      "end": 175.08
    },
    {
      "text": "So when you say for example, oh, I heard you were pregnant.",
      "trans": "英语：所以当你提到，比如说，我听说你怀孕了。",
      "start": 175.08,
      "end": 177.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Whoa.",
      "trans": "哇。",
      "start": 177.52,
      "end": 178.52
    },
    {
      "text": "This is like telling someone that you found some information about them, but you're not",
      "trans": "这句话可以被翻译成中文为：“这是让你知道他们有信息，但你并不了解。”",
      "start": 178.52,
      "end": 181.6
    },
    {
      "text": "sure if it's true or if it's false.",
