      "text": "Okay, so we've looked at some really good language for describing people.",
      "trans": "好的，我们已经看了几个很好的语言来描述人们。",
      "start": 576.12,
      "end": 578.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Now we could listen to our dialogue a third time and I'm sure you will understand everything.",
      "trans": "现在我们再次听了一遍对话，我相信你都会理解的。",
      "start": 578.72,
      "end": 583.08
    },
    {
      "text": "I heard you were in a day last night.",
      "trans": "我听说你昨晚在一天。",
      "start": 583.08,
      "end": 597.5200000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "So how did it go?",
